sycl: 1024-item work-groups for the decode-size Inkling 2 depth mix

HomeBrain patch on ggml-sycl. Applies on top of 0021.
Upstream tracking: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/32757

0019's depth mix runs one work-group per (token, query). At decode that is a
single work-group on the device, and its two passes over the 2304 hidden
values (the scores, then the weighted sum) are chains of dependent loads:
26 us per call, 88 calls per token. With at most 8 (token, query) pairs the
work-group now has 1024 items, so each pass takes 3 steps instead of 9;
prefill keeps 256.

